{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"3299","title":"Women's Day: Xiaomi Inspires Inclusion","desc":"A diverse and inclusive workplace is not just a commitment but a driving force behind innovation","view_cnt":"1464","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1715050716","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/814_operatorx_operatorx_xm/07/03/2024/c83d4745c811a15e18a631ac0b01aa18.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMarch 8th\u003c/strong\u003e - Xiaomi, a global technology leader, proudly joins the worldwide celebration of International Women's Day 2024. As a company dedicated to innovation and diversity, the company is committed to leveraging this occasion to highlight the importance of inclusivity and equality within the tech industry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi recognizes that a diverse and inclusive workplace is not just a commitment but a driving force behind innovation. The \"Xiaomi Inspires Inclusion\" campaign on International Women's Day 2024 reflects the company's dedication to building a world where every individual, regardless of gender, feels empowered to contribute their unique perspectives.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/48_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/03/2024/10c7a118ebbf9da5068ab2602b631edb.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"\u003cem\u003eBy promoting awareness and understanding of the diverse talents and perspectives, I think we can reshape perceptions and challenge preconceived notions. On a broader scale, collaboration with industry partners, participation in forums promoting gender diversity, and actively seeking out diverse talent during recruitment processes contribute to creating an environment where individuals of all genders feel welcome and valued\u003c/em\u003e\" \u003cstrong\u003estated\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003eJia Wei, Head of Marketing Xiaomi Western Europe\u003c/strong\u003e. \"\u003cem\u003eAt Xiaomi Western Europe, now about 42% of employees are women, a figure that is constantly growing and that underlines the company commitment to creating a balanced working environment\u003c/em\u003e\".\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/579_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/03/2024/ea4cf31dd2252d3234c3790c1b4ee6b8.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/39_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/03/2024/e03014b6760a74b8b34808a7e54cca98.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi believes that diversity and inclusion are not just buzzwords but essential principles for a thriving and innovative future. By leveraging International Women's Day 2024, the company aims to contribute to the global conversation on inclusivity and inspire positive change.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/710_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/03/2024/e67d954a36bbff7f3e2cf12aeb159fc2.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/921_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/03/2024/8faef665c0393fed2ba4cc6e493efc65.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: right\"\u003e\u003cem\u003ePhotos shot by @Marco D'Amico\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018. Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2023, MAU of MIUI reaching approximately 623 million globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 699 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2023. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2023, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the fifth year in a row, ranking 360th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"1823","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1709866708"},"common":null}